  "bodyHash": "0OPMqD6+J2Q=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s9IcuV5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available%20for%20Minecraft-1.19%20%7C%201.18%20%7C%201.17%20%7C%201.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install%20on-Client%20Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-mods-button/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 Описание:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Better Mods Button</strong> возвращает кнопку модов на экран паузы, как в версиях Forge до Minecraft 1.13, чтобы можно было легко получить доступ к конфигурации модов в игре (при наличии такой возможности).</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">В качестве бонуса есть множество вариантов того, где и как именно вы хотите видеть кнопку модов на экране (в значительной степени вдохновлено <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a>). Поддерживается отображение общего количества модов, а также переключение значка уведомления о обновлениях.</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 Медиа:</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/897/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/898/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Стандартная кнопка модов на главном экране</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>Одно из альтернативных расположений кнопки модов</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/899/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/900/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Стандартная кнопка модов на меню паузы</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>Альтернативное расположение для экрана паузы</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/901/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Еще одно альтернативное расположение кнопки на экране паузы</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 Часто задаваемые вопросы:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>В: Как настроить этот мод?</strong><br /><strong>О:</strong> Установите мой мод <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> и сделайте это прямо в игре!</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>В: А как насчет порта для Fabric?</strong><br /><strong>О:</strong> Вместо этого используйте <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a> от <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>ProspectorDev</strong></span></a>.</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 Кредиты:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Разработка Better Mods Button была поддержана и вдохновлена:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>ProspectorDev</strong></span></a> — за вдохновение большинства настроек этого мода, взятых из их мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs%200212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
